=== Round of 16 ===
The round of 16 opened with a series of controlled victories for the seeded teams. Balisca defeated Kaneda 2–0 in Heung Gong, while Volisania edged Nakamizu 2–1 in Gwong-zau. Burawa advanced with a 3–1 win over Jarin in San-wui, and Asikyira eliminated Skade 2–0 in Heung Gong. Sanrobonia overcame Daras 2–1 in Gwong-zau, Varkana narrowly defeated Sanyan 1–0 in San-wui, Aetolia beat Orma 1–0 in Heung Gong, and United Midlands defeated Louyang 2–1 in Gwong-zau.

=== Quarter-finals ===
The quarter-finals produced four distinct contests. Balisca defeated Aetolia 2–0 at Heung Gong National Stadium, while Sanrobonia overpowered United Midlands 3–1 at Gwong-zau Olympic Stadium. Burawa then defeated Varkana 2–1 at San-wui Municipal Stadium, and Asikyira completed the round by beating Volisania 1–0 at Heung Gong National Stadium.

=== Semi-finals ===
The semi-finals confirmed the final pairing between Balisca and Sanrobonia. Balisca defeated Burawa 2–1 at Heung Gong National Stadium, while Sanrobonia edged Asikyira 1–0 at Gwong-zau Olympic Stadium.

=== Match for third place ===
Asikyira finished third after defeating Burawa 2–0 in the match for third place at San-wui Municipal Stadium.

=== Final ===
The final was played at Heung Gong Stadium, where Balisca defeated Sanrobonia 2–1 to win their fourth AFA World Cup title.

